stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Locked: acquire project artifact lock
    Locked --> Staging: create unique job staging directory
    Staging --> Staging: write deck, media, diagrams, theme, and render outputs
    Staging --> Validating: build complete ResourceArtifactManifest
    Validating --> RolledBack: missing file, unsafe path, symlink, or cancellation
    Validating --> Committing: manifest identity and every declared file validate
    Committing --> Committed: rename staging directory to immutable revision
    Committed --> Current: atomically replace current.json pointer
    Current --> Publishing: optional processed PDF publication
    Publishing --> Completed: atomic publication rename succeeds
    Publishing --> CompletedWithWarning: publication fails after workspace commit
    Current --> Completed: no publication requested
    RolledBack --> [*]
    Completed --> [*]
    CompletedWithWarning --> [*]

    note right of Committing
      The whole revision is one directory rename.
      Existing revisions are immutable and never replaced.
    end note
